post.description:
Creates a new document image. Images are placed using the 'target' attribute which specifies whether the image is for a gallery or inline in a document.

The image must be uploaded as Base64-encoded content with a file name.

Required attributes:

- target: { type: 'gallery'|'document', id: integer }
- image.content: Base64-encoded image data
- image.file-name: Original filename with extension

Example request (Gallery image):

```
{
  "data": {
    "type": "document-images",
    "attributes": {
      "target": {
        "type": "gallery",
        "id": 12
      },
      "image": {
        "content": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mNk+M9QDwADhgGAWjR9awAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==",
        "file-name": "test-image.png"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

Example request (Inline image):

```
{
  "data": {
    "type": "document-images",
    "attributes": {
      "target": {
        "type": "document",
        "id": 42
      },
      "image": {
        "content": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mNk+M9QDwADhgGAWjR9awAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==",
        "file-name": "inline-diagram.png"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

The response includes URLs for all generated image variants and the target attribute:

```
{
  "data": {
    "id": "17",
    "type": "document-images",
    "attributes": {
      "name": "test-image.png",
      "size": 12345,
