}
```

post.description:
Add user/group resource accesses to the resource specified in the ID parameter. All user/groups accessible by an API key can be used to assign resource accesses. Returns the created object(s) if successful. Multiple user/group resource accesses can be created in bulk.

The request body must contain a JSON object, for example:

```
{
  "data": {
    "type": "resource-accesses",
    "attributes": {
      "accessor-type": "User",
      "accessor-id": 1
    }
  }
}
```

To create multiple resource accesses, the JSON object will look something like:

```
{
  "data": [
    {
      "type": "resource-accesses",
      "attributes": {
        "accessor-type": "User",
        "accessor-id": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "resource-accesses",
      "attributes": {...}
    }
  ]
}
```

patch.description:
Edit user/group resource accesses to a resource. The “accessor-type” can be “User” or “Group”, depending on who is being granted access to the resource. The “accessor-id” is the id value for the “Group” or “User” being granted access.

All resource-accesses are replaced by the supplied payload, and any pre-existing resource-accesses not included by the new collection are deleted.

Returns the updated list of “resource accesses” for the resource and a 200 status code if successful.

Below is a sample request body with a JSON array to update a resource's access.

```
{
  "data": [
      {
        "type": "resource-accesses",
        "attributes": {
          "accessor-id": 2,
          "accessor-type": "User"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "resource-accesses",
        "attributes": {
          "accessor-id": 1,
          "accessor-type": "Group"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "resource-accesses",
        "attributes": {...}
      }
  ]
}
```

delete.description:
Deletes one or more specified resource accesses. Returns the deleted resource accesses and a 200 status code if successful.

Below is a sample request body with a JSON array to delete multiple objects:

```
{
  "data": [
    {
      "type": "resource-accesses",
      "attributes": {
        "accessor-type": "User",
        "accessor-id": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "resource-accesses",
      "attributes": {
        "accessor-type": "Group",
        "accessor-id": 2
      }
    }
  ]
}
```
